        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          We burned wood, scorched oil, and lit cigarettes in a sealed test room, then measured how fast 12 purifiers pulled PM2.5 back down and whether the smell went with it. Only 7 did both.
